---
import {href} from '../data/course';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Deep Learning Quest · FR / EN</title><meta name="description" content="Un cours de deep learning en français et en anglais. Deep learning lessons, revision notes and interactive quizzes."/><link rel="icon" href={href('favicon.svg')}/></head><body><main class="language-welcome" data-root={href()}><img src={href('favicon.svg')} alt="" width="64" height="64"/><p class="eyebrow">DEEP LEARNING QUEST</p><h1>Choisis ta langue.<br/><span lang="en">Choose your language.</span></h1><p>Tu pourras changer de langue à tout moment.<br/><span lang="en">You can switch languages at any time.</span></p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={href('fr/')} lang="fr">Français <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button" href={href('en/')} lang="en">English <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></main><script>const root=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-root]')?.dataset.root||'/';try{const lang=localStorage.getItem('dl-quest.language.v1');if(lang==='fr'||lang==='en')location.replace(`${root}${lang}/`);}catch{/* The visible language chooser remains available. */}</script></body></html>
